flowchart LR
  U["Uniform random numbers"] --> INV["Inverse CDF<br/>when you can invert the CDF"]
  U --> REJ["Rejection sampling<br/>propose, accept with p(x)/(M·q(x))"]
  U --> IMP["Importance sampling<br/>reweight samples by p/q"]
  U --> MC["MCMC (Metropolis–Hastings)<br/>a chain that settles into p"]
  INV --> EST["Monte Carlo estimate:<br/>average f over the samples"]
  REJ --> EST
  IMP --> EST
  MC --> EST
